            "content": "<p>Quality is non-negotiable. Unlike standard fashion jewelry, Aurea pieces are designed to last.</p><p><strong>Waterproof Technology:</strong> We use advanced PVD Plating technology. This ensures the gold color is bonded to the metal, making it vibrant and resistant to fading.</p><p><strong>Warranty:</strong> We stand by our quality with a 2-Year Color Warranty. If it fades, we replace it.</p>"
          }
